:" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"Swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryID:entryLabel:)-53g21":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryID:entryLabel:)-53g21","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityRotor"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"EntryModel"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"ID"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entries